// SOURCE: examples/openhtop/main.vl
// ARGS: --help
// EXPECT: openhtop 0.1
// EXPECT: A process monitor in the terminal, after htop
// EXPECT:
// EXPECT: usage: openhtop [options]
// EXPECT:
// EXPECT: options:
// EXPECT:       --demo             show a fixed snapshot instead of the system's
// EXPECT:       --once             print one frame and exit
// EXPECT:       --no-color         no ANSI colors
// EXPECT:   -d, --delay <MS>       milliseconds between refreshes [default: 1500]
// EXPECT:   -s, --sort <FIELD>     cpu, mem, pid, time or command [default: cpu]
// EXPECT:       --width <COLUMNS>  width (a terminal's is used otherwise) [default: 0]
// EXPECT:       --height <ROWS>    height (a terminal's is used otherwise) [default: 0]
// EXPECT:       --pid <PID>        show only this process [default: 0]
// EXPECT:       --filter <TEXT>    show only processes whose command or user contains TEXT [default: ]
// EXPECT:   -h, --help             print this help
// EXPECT:   -V, --version          print the version
